WEBVTT

00:09.340 --> 00:12.030
<i>Nothing. It's nothing.</i>

00:32.560 --> 00:33.490
<b>Touko!</b>

00:33.960 --> 00:34.890
<b>What?</b>

00:34.890 --> 00:35.800
<b>What's wrong, Onee-chan?</b>

00:36.410 --> 00:37.590
<b>Touko-san?</b>

00:36.410 --> 00:37.590
<b>Touko?</b>

00:49.690 --> 00:50.810
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:55.090 --> 00:56.020
<b>I'll get them.</b>

00:59.640 --> 01:00.810
<b>Don't go.</b>

01:07.840 --> 01:09.030
<b>It's my fault.</b>

01:09.030 --> 01:15.220
<b>No, I asked to watch your 
mom play piano, too.</b>

01:15.730 --> 01:18.180
<b>I couldn't hear anything.</b>

01:18.180 --> 01:21.980
<b>But you felt something strong 
enough to make you pass out.</b>

01:21.980 --> 01:24.280
<b>So the experiment was a success?</b>

01:24.280 --> 01:25.230
<b>Maybe.</b>

01:25.890 --> 01:29.690
<b>But I might have put you in danger.</b>

01:29.880 --> 01:32.850
<b>I'm fine. Besides—</b>

01:36.440 --> 01:38.860
<b>Whenever I try to stay in one place,</b>

01:38.860 --> 01:41.400
<b>I get other people mixed up in my problems.</b>

01:43.690 --> 01:44.790
<b>Touko,</b>

01:47.310 --> 01:48.470
<b>are you okay?</b>

01:48.470 --> 01:50.870
<b>I want to stay here a little longer.</b>

01:51.600 --> 01:53.480
<b>O-Onee-chan.</b>

01:53.480 --> 01:57.310
<b>You're right. You should 
stay put a little longer.</b>

01:57.310 --> 01:59.930
<b>I want to make beads when I get home.</b>

01:59.930 --> 02:01.010
<b>Yeah?</b>

02:08.190 --> 02:13.730
<b>Final Episode:
"Shooting Star"</b>

02:14.480 --> 02:17.970
<b>Are you sure we should 
have left Onee-chan there?</b>

02:17.970 --> 02:19.150
<b>I'm sure.</b>

02:19.410 --> 02:22.240
<b>I wonder what happened to her, though.</b>

02:22.240 --> 02:23.890
<b>I wonder.</b>

02:24.300 --> 02:26.410
<b>She's getting to that age.</b>

02:26.710 --> 02:29.980
<b>What? Are you saying I'm the only kid here?</b>

02:29.980 --> 02:32.210
<b>You're almost an adult, too.</b>

02:32.210 --> 02:33.750
<b>It'll happen before you know it.</b>

02:37.090 --> 02:38.260
<b>One more piece?</b>

02:38.520 --> 02:41.970
<b>Yes, please. I'll go home after that.</b>

02:43.700 --> 02:45.220
<b>Are you sure?</b>

02:45.220 --> 02:46.060
<b>Yes.</b>

02:46.620 --> 02:49.810
<b>Um! Something really dramatic.</b>

02:53.490 --> 02:55.240
<b>Okay, got it.</b>

02:56.640 --> 02:58.530
<i>I'm not afraid.</i>

02:59.030 --> 03:01.780
<i>It's not a future that's about to happen.</i>

03:02.740 --> 03:06.250
<i>But Kakeru-kun...</i>

03:12.270 --> 03:14.140
<i>Kakeru-kun will be gone.</i>

03:17.220 --> 03:19.260
<b>Thanks for waiting.</b>

03:20.340 --> 03:24.650
<b>I'm surprised you all 
ordered Mandheling, though.</b>

03:29.370 --> 03:32.390
<b>I'm nervous for some reason.</b>

03:32.390 --> 03:34.270
<b>Yeah. I feel weird.</b>

03:41.920 --> 03:43.010
<b>It's bitter.</b>

03:43.910 --> 03:46.530
<b>I wish Touko-san were here, too.</b>

03:46.530 --> 03:50.080
<b>Remember when the five of us used to
get together randomly all the time?</b>

03:50.290 --> 03:52.060
<b>I'll try calling her.</b>

03:54.960 --> 03:56.040
<b>What's up?</b>

03:56.640 --> 03:58.360
<b>I want to meet her by chance.</b>

03:59.550 --> 04:01.880
<b>That's a nice thing to say 
for once, coming from you.</b>

04:02.140 --> 04:03.530
<b>For once, yeah.</b>

04:08.790 --> 04:11.550
<b>Sorry, I rocked the boat.</b>

04:12.830 --> 04:14.720
<b>I'll tell you both, too.</b>

04:15.240 --> 04:16.520
<b>You don't have to.</b>

04:17.560 --> 04:20.490
<b>Everyone has secrets.</b>

04:21.700 --> 04:24.990
<b>Well, small ones.</b>

04:26.250 --> 04:28.930
<b>Maybe it's because we all 
got together for coffee.</b>

04:59.380 --> 05:00.700
<b>Morning.</b>

05:00.700 --> 05:01.500
<b>Morning.</b>

05:01.500 --> 05:02.630
<b>Morning.</b>

05:04.590 --> 05:06.550
<b>Huh, where's Onee-chan?</b>

05:07.410 --> 05:08.440
<b>Dunno.</b>

05:08.440 --> 05:10.280
<b>Is she in the studio again so early?</b>

05:10.680 --> 05:11.580
<b>Hina,</b>

05:12.420 --> 05:16.600
<b>it looks like that girl came home in
a huge hurry to finish her homework.</b>

05:16.600 --> 05:17.810
<b>Don't get in her way.</b>

05:18.230 --> 05:19.750
<b>Fine.</b>

05:20.530 --> 05:24.540
<b>Hey, Hina, it says there's going 
to be a meteor shower today.</b>

05:25.040 --> 05:27.870
<b>Brings back memories of that night.</b>

05:27.870 --> 05:31.130
<b>Mari said she wanted to 
watch the meteor showers,</b>

05:31.130 --> 05:33.670
<b>so I decided to propose.</b>

05:33.670 --> 05:35.860
<b>Dad, move your newspaper.</b>

05:59.550 --> 06:00.620
<b>Kakeru,</b>

06:01.730 --> 06:03.560
<b>have you decided?</b>

06:06.080 --> 06:08.590
<b>You're a grown-up, now.</b>

06:08.590 --> 06:13.810
<b>You can do whatever you like, 
and I'll help out as much as I can.</b>

06:14.590 --> 06:17.020
<b>It was pretty tough until middle school.</b>

06:17.370 --> 06:20.480
<b>You're a kid until middle school, 
a grown-up in high school.</b>

06:20.480 --> 06:23.390
<b>That's where the line is for me, anyway.</b>

06:23.730 --> 06:25.840
<b>And not for any real reason.</b>

06:26.460 --> 06:28.900
<b>So you're still hiking, huh?</b>

06:29.340 --> 06:34.820
<b>Yeah, though not so much hiking as 
just walking around the foothills.</b>

06:35.360 --> 06:38.910
<b>Remember you weren't so enthusiastic 
about it when I first invited you?</b>

06:39.450 --> 06:41.990
<b>Yeah, I eventually got into it.</b>

06:41.990 --> 06:44.830
<b>It's been a while since we 
stopped hiking together.</b>

06:44.830 --> 06:47.260
<b>Can you keep up with me, Dad?</b>

06:47.510 --> 06:49.010
<b>That's quite a statement.</b>

06:49.360 --> 06:52.490
<b>Hey, dear, come help.</b>

06:53.440 --> 06:54.710
<b>I'll get it.</b>

06:54.710 --> 06:55.850
<b>Thanks.</b>

06:57.050 --> 06:57.960
<b>Yes?</b>

06:58.780 --> 06:59.790
<b>Takayama.</b>

07:18.640 --> 07:19.960
<b>Let's take a short break.</b>

07:23.120 --> 07:27.940
<b>Hina-chan tells me your 
mom held a piano recital.</b>

07:28.390 --> 07:30.060
<b>It wasn't really a recital.</b>

07:30.470 --> 07:32.260
<b>Nothing so grand.</b>

07:32.810 --> 07:35.120
<b>You should invite me next time, too.</b>

07:35.560 --> 07:36.550
<b>Takayama, you're—</b>

07:36.550 --> 07:37.450
<b>Yanagi.</b>

07:38.850 --> 07:40.220
<b>Call me Yanagi.</b>

07:40.830 --> 07:43.270
<b>Do you like classical music?</b>

07:43.860 --> 07:45.440
<b>Actually, I listen to it quite a bit.</b>

08:02.340 --> 08:05.270
<b>Your tea's always so good, Mom.</b>

08:06.110 --> 08:07.250
<b>Thanks.</b>

08:07.830 --> 08:10.060
<b>Say, Touko, have you ever</b>

08:10.060 --> 08:14.790
<b>seen something in a haze when 
you're suddenly in a bright light?</b>

08:15.910 --> 08:20.210
<b>That'd happen to me sometimes 
when I was young,</b>

08:20.210 --> 08:25.520
<b>and I even thought it 
might have been my future.</b>

08:27.390 --> 08:28.780
<b>But it wasn't.</b>

08:29.330 --> 08:33.770
<b>Everything that happened 
afterwards was totally unexpected.</b>

08:34.290 --> 08:36.650
<b>I wonder what it was, anyway.</b>

08:38.380 --> 08:40.150
<b>Does that help you move on?</b>

08:41.310 --> 08:45.420
<b>I don't know, but it's 
all I can do right now.</b>

08:45.990 --> 08:49.340
<b>You're right. You have 
to do everything you can.</b>

08:58.240 --> 08:59.760
<b>You have to fulfill your promise.</b>

09:00.380 --> 09:02.730
<b>I'll remind you if you've forgotten.</b>

09:03.010 --> 09:04.300
<b>I remember.</b>

09:04.880 --> 09:06.940
<b>I've promised you only one thing.</b>

09:10.460 --> 09:11.420
<b>Want to sit?</b>

09:11.420 --> 09:12.610
<b>Tell me later.</b>

09:15.250 --> 09:17.710
<b>I heard the gist of it from Sachi.</b>

09:19.600 --> 09:20.580
<b>I see.</b>

09:21.580 --> 09:23.700
<b>The incident at the beach where I was forced</b>

09:23.700 --> 09:26.920
<b>to make that promise with you, 
and this time, when Touko collapsed—</b>

09:26.920 --> 09:28.080
<b>both are my fault.</b>

09:30.860 --> 09:33.450
<b>How much of that am I supposed to believe?</b>

09:33.930 --> 09:36.310
<b>It's hard to believe all of it.</b>

09:37.010 --> 09:39.580
<b>I don't mind, but it's the truth.</b>

09:39.580 --> 09:43.230
<b>Besides, it's true that I 
needed Touko to be here.</b>

09:44.150 --> 09:47.850
<b>But if I weren't here, 
Touko wouldn't have gone through all this.</b>

09:48.270 --> 09:49.970
<b>I hurt Touko.</b>

09:50.500 --> 09:54.150
<b>I don't even have a clue what Touko saw.</b>

09:55.610 --> 09:57.320
<b>It's not all good,</b>

09:58.240 --> 09:59.490
<b>coming to an epiphany.</b>

10:03.000 --> 10:03.700
<b>What?</b>

10:04.690 --> 10:06.150
<b>Are you talking about Yukinari Imi?</b>

10:07.730 --> 10:09.730
<b>Yeah, it's about Yuki.</b>

10:10.340 --> 10:14.460
<b>He doesn't need to say anything 
for me to know what he's thinking.</b>

10:14.990 --> 10:17.470
<b>Yeah, that does sound a bit troublesome.</b>

10:18.500 --> 10:19.720
<b>So,</b>

10:20.300 --> 10:23.350
<b>Kakeru, are you going away?</b>

10:25.390 --> 10:26.970
<b>I get that feeling.</b>

10:28.720 --> 10:30.250
<b>I'm heading out.</b>

10:30.250 --> 10:31.710
<b>Be careful.</b>

10:33.540 --> 10:35.820
<b>Where's she going this
 late in the afternoon?</b>

10:35.820 --> 10:38.410
<b>I don't know, but she was pretty excited.</b>

10:38.410 --> 10:40.610
<b>Where's Onee-chan off to so late?</b>

10:40.980 --> 10:44.120
<b>My, my, everyone's worried about Onee-chan.</b>

11:28.090 --> 11:29.410
<b>Kakeru-kun?</b>

11:30.040 --> 11:30.860
<b>Touko.</b>

11:39.640 --> 11:41.300
<b>Can I sit next to you?</b>

11:41.730 --> 11:42.720
<b>Sure.</b>

11:51.210 --> 11:53.910
<b>There's supposed to be 
a meteor shower tonight.</b>

11:54.550 --> 11:56.660
<b>It'll be great if we can watch it 
again, the way we did the fireworks.</b>

11:57.100 --> 11:59.780
<b>I hope we can watch the 
fireworks together again.</b>

12:01.030 --> 12:02.570
<b>Maybe not with this weather.</b>

12:03.680 --> 12:04.870
<b>Fireworks in the winter.</b>

12:06.100 --> 12:06.990
<b>In the winter?</b>

12:07.590 --> 12:09.590
<b>In the fragment of the future,</b>

12:09.590 --> 12:12.120
<b>we decided to watch the 
fireworks in the winter.</b>

12:12.490 --> 12:13.450
<b>So did you?</b>

12:13.450 --> 12:14.180
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:15.430 --> 12:16.840
<b>I went alone.</b>

12:16.840 --> 12:17.880
<b>And the others?</b>

12:18.770 --> 12:20.810
<b>They didn't notice me.</b>

12:21.360 --> 12:24.340
<b>I see, so you watched them alone.</b>

12:25.790 --> 12:28.530
<b>It was the first time I ever 
watched the fireworks alone.</b>

12:30.490 --> 12:34.350
<b>It might have been a sudden, 
expected loneliness.</b>

12:35.580 --> 12:38.350
<b>I wish I saw it, too.</b>

12:38.780 --> 12:40.450
<b>You were watching, too.</b>

12:40.450 --> 12:41.490
<b>With the others.</b>

12:42.320 --> 12:44.360
<b>Did that me seem happy?</b>

12:44.360 --> 12:45.830
<b>Yeah, very.</b>

12:46.370 --> 12:47.650
<b>That's good.</b>

12:49.990 --> 12:52.850
<b>I wonder what the fragments 
of the future really were.</b>

12:53.270 --> 12:56.430
<b>Maybe that name isn't appropriate anymore.</b>

12:58.120 --> 12:59.640
<b>Mom said—</b>

13:00.320 --> 13:01.690
<b>Never mind.</b>

13:04.880 --> 13:08.270
<b>There you go with your "never mind" again.</b>

13:10.020 --> 13:14.430
<b>But whenever you say that, 
it was actually something important.</b>

13:16.070 --> 13:18.420
<b>Am I that obvious?</b>

13:18.420 --> 13:19.440
<b>Not really.</b>

13:20.010 --> 13:21.070
<b>I see.</b>

13:21.740 --> 13:22.890
<b>I guess.</b>

13:22.890 --> 13:24.240
<b>Something important.</b>

13:24.590 --> 13:28.030
<b>That day of the fireworks 
festival, I saw you.</b>

13:28.710 --> 13:30.250
<b>Was that a coincidence?</b>

13:30.250 --> 13:31.700
<b>Not quite.</b>

13:32.360 --> 13:33.650
<b>It wasn't a coincidence.</b>

13:34.300 --> 13:37.000
<b>You saw it because you wanted to see it.</b>

13:39.740 --> 13:41.750
<b>It wasn't the future.</b>

13:41.750 --> 13:46.010
<b>It's something that hasn't happened, 
but it's sure to happen.</b>

13:47.100 --> 13:49.780
<b>What? Isn't that the same thing?</b>

13:50.190 --> 13:51.850
<b>Did you mean it to be the same thing?</b>

13:53.070 --> 13:54.270
<b>Maybe not.</b>

13:55.100 --> 13:57.850
<b>Then it probably means something else.</b>

14:01.120 --> 14:03.330
<b>I wanted to see you.</b>

14:03.930 --> 14:05.630
<b>I wanted to see you.</b>

14:06.230 --> 14:07.860
<b>So I saw you?</b>

14:08.810 --> 14:13.370
<b>And the sound and lights from the 
fireworks might have made it happen.</b>

14:13.840 --> 14:16.150
<b>It was really loud and bright, huh?</b>

14:16.620 --> 14:18.550
<b>But why me?</b>

14:19.020 --> 14:23.590
<b>I couldn't do anything for you, 
even during the fireworks in the winter.</b>

14:23.970 --> 14:28.130
<b>I just felt like I understood 
how you feel a little better.</b>

14:28.720 --> 14:32.750
<b>I couldn't do anything for you.</b>

14:33.930 --> 14:35.640
<b>That's enough.</b>

14:36.190 --> 14:37.630
<b>It is?</b>

14:38.900 --> 14:41.080
<b>I'm glad I met you in this town.</b>

14:42.680 --> 14:46.340
<b>I'm glad you came to this town.</b>

14:49.870 --> 14:51.600
<b>Can't see the stars.</b>

14:52.920 --> 14:53.780
<b>Oh, yeah,</b>

14:54.380 --> 14:57.260
<b>maybe these will be stars.</b>

14:58.700 --> 15:00.670
<b>You made all these?</b>

15:00.670 --> 15:01.570
<b>Yup.</b>

15:02.250 --> 15:03.220
<b>Wow.</b>

15:31.790 --> 15:33.530
<b>Ready, and...</b>

15:51.160 --> 15:52.530
<b>Shooting stars.</b>

15:52.530 --> 15:53.350
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:53.820 --> 15:55.750
<b>You see them, too?</b>

15:55.750 --> 15:56.760
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:06.860 --> 16:10.640
<i>This year's meteor shower 
comes unusually late.</i>

16:10.640 --> 16:14.530
<i>The peak of the Kappa Cygnids meteor 
shower reaches its peak today;</i>

16:14.530 --> 16:17.470
<i>unfortunately there is cloud 
cover throughout much of Japan,</i>

16:17.470 --> 16:18.450
<i>and it may not be visible—</i>

16:19.570 --> 16:21.260
<b>I wanted to see it.</b>

16:21.260 --> 16:22.630
<b>I know.</b>

16:27.260 --> 16:28.420
<b>I can see it!</b>

16:29.300 --> 16:30.510
<b>You can?</b>

16:48.320 --> 16:48.810
<b>It...</b>

16:50.100 --> 16:52.040
<b>was a beautiful proposal.</b>

16:53.100 --> 16:56.630
<b>When we first met and when 
we went on our first date,</b>

16:56.630 --> 16:58.830
<b>you were so desperate.</b>

16:59.440 --> 17:02.310
<b>You won me over.</b>

17:30.470 --> 17:33.880
<b>Why is Jonathan the only Jonathan?</b>

17:35.710 --> 17:37.460
<b>Are you okay, Yuki-kun?</b>

17:37.460 --> 17:39.810
<b>It's still hot outside.</b>

17:39.810 --> 17:41.290
<b>No,</b>

17:41.880 --> 17:44.670
<b>I mean, the rest of them all 
have philosophers' names.</b>

17:45.520 --> 17:48.500
<b>What? Then what about Jonathan?</b>

17:48.840 --> 17:51.350
<b>An adventurer, arguably?</b>

17:51.820 --> 17:55.260
<b>You've been drawing them all 
the time. You didn't know?</b>

17:56.540 --> 17:58.020
<b>I didn't know.</b>

18:00.070 --> 18:02.460
<b>Summer break's almost over.</b>

18:03.920 --> 18:07.350
<b>I hope no matter what happens from now on,</b>

18:07.810 --> 18:11.980
<b>my future self will solve it all for me!</b>

18:13.670 --> 18:16.530
<b>You haven't changed at all.</b>

18:19.370 --> 18:20.530
<b>Have you?</b>

18:47.370 --> 18:49.650
<b>He's back on track lately.</b>

18:49.840 --> 18:51.630
<b>Here he comes.</b>

18:52.610 --> 18:53.290
<b>What?</b>

18:53.290 --> 18:54.930
<b>Oh, come on.</b>

18:54.930 --> 18:56.690
<b>It's over.</b>

18:57.040 --> 18:58.420
<b>Hina.</b>

18:58.420 --> 18:59.280
<b>Where's Hina?</b>

19:00.290 --> 19:02.780
<b>Hina, explain, dammit!</b>

19:02.780 --> 19:04.160
<b>Hina!</b>

19:16.300 --> 19:17.300
<b>Adjust focus there.</b>

19:23.100 --> 19:24.030
<b>I see it.</b>

19:30.200 --> 19:32.210
<b>I like the name Touko.</b>

19:33.080 --> 19:33.960
<b>Sure.</b>

19:35.510 --> 19:38.220
<b>But I love the name Hiro, too.</b>

19:38.740 --> 19:40.740
<b>Kazemichi</b>

19:44.230 --> 19:45.920
<b>Should I help with something?</b>

19:46.270 --> 19:48.660
<b>You're a customer for today.</b>

19:54.770 --> 19:56.020
<b>Welcome.</b>

19:56.020 --> 19:58.670
<b>You're late.</b>

20:15.890 --> 20:18.570
<b>Isn't she going to be late?</b>

20:21.280 --> 20:22.280
<b>Huh?</b>

20:22.570 --> 20:26.490
<b>Summer break's over for 
us youngins, unlike you.</b>

20:26.820 --> 20:29.160
<b>There's something wrong. 
You didn't sleep in.</b>

20:29.160 --> 20:30.970
<b>Did something good happen?</b>

20:33.260 --> 20:36.270
<b>That tragic glasses girl is coming to school.</b>

20:36.270 --> 20:37.050
<b>Ack!</b>

20:37.430 --> 20:41.400
<b>Good for you. I'll give 
you a lift to celebrate.</b>

20:41.400 --> 20:46.350
<b>The only way I'd be late today would
be because you gave me a ride.</b>

20:46.670 --> 20:47.810
<b>Tee hee.</b>

20:53.560 --> 20:56.440
<b>This is another benefit of running, I guess.</b>

21:11.390 --> 21:12.880
<b>I'm leaving.</b>

21:12.880 --> 21:14.080
<b>I'm leaving.</b>

21:14.960 --> 21:17.630
<b>Watch for cars, you two.</b>

21:44.750 --> 21:45.570
<i>Touko.</i>
